00:06:13.960 --> 00:06:16.760
We'll get to see a lot of new places inside the city.

00:06:16.760 --> 00:06:21.360
Although I'm most excited to see the Water Gardens in Dorne. That's going to blow your mind. That and Braavos. 

00:06:21.360 --> 00:06:24.082
You will see those places like you've never seen before.

